Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 03:24:32 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1138/1178] A frozen workspace in the Librarian (1166, part
 eighteen)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Viktor 04.10.2026: «Деактивация воркспейса. Замораживаются все треки в этом представлении,
никаких действий по ним, в `All Workspaces` и в поиске не отображаются. Сам деактивированный
воркспейс немного засЕривается как неактивный».

⋯ → Freeze… (asked first, saying what it does); frozen, the workspace is greyed in the column
with ❄, its menu only Open and Unfreeze (a section frozen with its parent says so). Its frozen
takes show only inside it, greyed: the play button and the title answer, the check, rename,
like, dislike, favourite and Refine do not, nor dragging, Shift ranges, the band or Ctrl+A; a
take's menu is Play, the datasheet and «Frozen with its workspace». They leave All Workspaces,
the search, Favourites, Pinned and the counts. The words in the seven languages (16 keys, the
lab's refusals with each language's plural forms).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
